<title>UK: AMEC pretax profits doubled to 12.1 mln stg.</title>
<headline>AMEC pretax profits doubled to 12.1 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>6 months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		1.6		    vs 0.3 loss</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.5		    vs 1.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     12.1		   vs 6.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   1.32 billion	 vs 1.13 billion</p>
<p> Operating result	 16.4		   vs 11.4</p>
<p> Interest payable	 4.3		    vs 2.3</p>
<p> Tax			  3.0		    vs 0.9</p>
<p> Net taxed		  9.1		    vs 5.2</p>
<p> Pay date		   January 2</p>
<p>Div registration date  October 29  Ex-div date		October 21</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
